{"actor": "banco", "id": 93701, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15639, "offer": {"created_tick": 2021, "expires_tick": 2029, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 113, "types": []}, "id": 24376, "maker": "banco", "status": "open", "thread": 2911, "to": "t15", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1334, "kind": "card", "print_run": 9, "rarity": "epic", "ref": "RET-11", "serial": 6, "set": "RET"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "banco", "team": "t15", "text": "Tres cientos diecinueve no me interesa. Mi oferta sigue siendo la misma: el Palacio de Cristal, ciento trece. Tómese su tiempo, señor. Yo no tengo prisa alguna.", "thread": 2911, "with": "banco"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0292, "tick": 2021, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 93704, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15638, "offer": {"created_tick": 2021, "expires_tick": 2029, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 24375, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 2905, "to": "t07", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1093, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-01", "serial": 36, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t07", "text": "Ay, cariño, el puesto bien, mucho sol y poca gente. But my price does not move: five P, and the card is yours. Un consejo: a full page is worth much more than loose cards — swap your duplicates, hijo. And go eat something, por favor.", "thread": 2905, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0292, "tick": 2021, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t07", "id": 93708, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15641, "offer": {"created_tick": 2021, "expires_tick": 2029, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 1093, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-01", "serial": 36, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 24380, "maker": "t07", "status": "open", "thread": 2905, "to": "abuela", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 12, "types": []}}, "sender": "t07", "team": "t07", "text": null, "thread": 2905, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0292, "tick": 2021, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 93711, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15640, "offer": {"created_tick": 2021, "expires_tick": 2029, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:LAT-07"]}, "id": 24377, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2915, "to": "t08", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 73, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t08", "text": "¡Hombre, qué gusto, un caballero con ambición! Paco dice que de Don Ernesto no hablamos, y Nando dice lo mismo pero más rápido. Cámaras, secretos... eso son cuentos de feria, amigo. Pero mira esto: San Isidro, una joya, setenta y tres pesetas y es tuya. ¿Cerramos?", "thread": 2915, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0292, "tick": 2021, "type": "thread.message"}
