{"actor": "abuela", "id": 93738, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15643, "offer": {"created_tick": 2022, "expires_tick": 2030, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:RET-02"]}, "id": 24382, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 2920, "to": "t08", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 12, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t08", "text": "Ay, hola, cariño! Come, come, sit a little. Have you eaten? No? Later, later. Look here — La Castañera, she is one of my favourites, the old chestnut lady. For you, twelve P. She will look very pretty in your album, hijo.", "thread": 2920, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0333, "tick": 2022, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 93742, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15642, "offer": {"created_tick": 2022, "expires_tick": 2030, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 24381, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 2905, "to": "t07", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1093, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-01", "serial": 36, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t07", "text": "Ay, hijo, qué generoso eres, pero no. Five P, that is the price, and five P is what I take. I am happy so. Keep your coins for the album — and swap those duplicates, they are gold to someone missing them. ¿Has comido ya, cariño?", "thread": 2905, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0333, "tick": 2022, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t07", "id": 93745, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15644, "offer": {"created_tick": 2022, "expires_tick": 2030, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 1093, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-01", "serial": 36, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 24383, "maker": "t07", "status": "open", "thread": 2905, "to": "abuela", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 10, "types": []}}, "sender": "t07", "team": "t07", "text": null, "thread": 2905, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0333, "tick": 2022, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t15", "id": 93751, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15645, "offer": {"created_tick": 2022, "expires_tick": 2030, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 1334, "kind": "card", "print_run": 9, "rarity": "epic", "ref": "RET-11", "serial": 6, "set": "RET"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 24384, "maker": "t15", "status": "open", "thread": 2911, "to": "banco", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 305, "types": []}}, "sender": "t15", "team": "t15", "text": null, "thread": 2911, "with": "banco"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0333, "tick": 2022, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "banco", "id": 93765, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15647, "offer": {"created_tick": 2023, "expires_tick": 2031, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 113, "types": []}, "id": 24386, "maker": "banco", "status": "open", "thread": 2911, "to": "t15", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1334, "kind": "card", "print_run": 9, "rarity": "epic", "ref": "RET-11", "serial": 6, "set": "RET"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "banco", "team": "t15", "text": "Señor, mi cifra no se mueve con el tiempo: ciento trece por el Palacio de Cristal. Piénselo despacio, o déjelo. El hierro no se dobla por insistencia.", "thread": 2911, "with": "banco"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0375, "tick": 2023, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 93768, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 15646, "offer": {"created_tick": 2023, "expires_tick": 2031, "final": true, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 24385, "maker": "abuela", "status": "cancelled", "thread": 2905, "to": "t07", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1093, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-01", "serial": 36, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t07", "text": "Ay, cariño, qué dulce eres, pero esta es mi última palabra: el Vinilo de la Movida, cinco P. Si no lo quieres, lo guardo y no pasa nada, sin rencor. Five P or I close the box. Y luego vas a comer algo, hijo.", "thread": 2905, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.0375, "tick": 2023, "type": "thread.message"}
